      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/kernel_ports.ts:426 accepts the elicitation decision without rechecking meta.signal before capability issuance at lines 469 and 599, so an outer cancellation arriving after the nested accept but before commit can still mint authority; recheck cancellation immediately before each capability issue/commit path and return user_cancelled."
    },
    {
      "id": "review-5ca352a3aaa2-2-review-2",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-native-elicitation-authority",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/mcp_server.ts:325 validates only result.action, so malformed accept results such as a non-object content value still authorize despite the external-boundary and malformed-response requirements; validate the complete elicitation result against the requested empty-object schema before returning accept."
    },
    {
      "id": "review-b8cc2066e6ee-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-native-elicitation-authority",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/mcp_server.ts:387-400 validates jsonrpc and ID shape before correlating pending elicitation responses, so a malformed envelope carrying the exact outstanding ID leaves the outer privileged Tool call pending indefinitely instead of failing closed; detect pending IDs first and reject the waiter with correlation_missing for every malformed matching envelope."
    },
    {
      "id": "review-b8cc2066e6ee-2-review-2",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
