      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "acc-native-elicitation-authority",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 4,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/mcp_server.ts:249 waits only for `drain` when `output.write()` returns false, and serveStdio registers shutdown/error handling only on the input stream at lines 446-461. If the Host disconnects or stdout errors while elicitation is pending, the write can reject asynchronously or wait forever without `drain`; the in-flight Tool call then never settles and executeShutdown blocks at line 435, violating the required disconnect/shutdown behavior. Make writes settle on drain, error, or close, handle output failure by rejecting pending elicitation, and add a deterministic pending-elicitation output-disconnect test."
